        "description": {
          "text": "Added new indication for Inlyta in combination with avelumab or pembrolizumab for first-line treatment of advanced renal cell carcinoma",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for updates to the Inlyta Prescribing Information to include a new indication for use of Inlyta in combination with avelumab or pembrolizumab for the first-line treatment of patients with advanced renal cell carcinoma. This supplement also provides for updates to section 6.2 of the Prescribing Information in response to the Supplement Request letter dated May 21, 2020.",
